### Font Asset Licensing
Font assets delivered by this distribution platform are created by their respective foundries and designers under permissive open licenses (primarily SIL Open Font License v1.1, Apache License 2.0, Ubuntu Font License, and CC0/Public Domain). Full per-font licensing and designer credits are tracked in Metadata/fonts.json.
